entries[474602] = { ["name"] = "Blastburn Roarcannon", ["text"] = "60 yd range\nInstant\nFlarendo tracks a target while charging, then locks in place and prepares to fire. Once ready, it fires a beam over the next 3 sec. The beam inflicts 66606435 Fire damage every 0.1 sec to players on contact, obliterating them." }
